# =============================================================================
# Security Audit Suppression
# =============================================================================
# Advisory: GHSA-qwww-vcr4-c8h2 (source: 1124282)
# Package:  react-router 7.18.2 / react-router-dom 7.18.2
# Severity: High (CVSS: N/A)
# CWE:      CWE-352 (CSRF)
# Title:    RSC Mode CSRF Bypass — Action Execution Before 400 Response
#
# ACCEPTED RISK — REASON:
# This vulnerability ONLY affects applications using the unstable React Server
# Components (RSC) APIs (unstable_RSCStaticRouter, etc.).
# JewelCart uses React Router in standard SPA/DOM routing mode only.
# No RSC APIs are used anywhere in this application.
# npm's advisory database flags the version range >=7.12.0 <8.3.0 broadly,
# but the maintainers explicitly note this does not affect non-RSC apps.
# See: https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-qwww-vcr4-c8h2
#
# REVIEWED BY: dhanushri
# REVIEW DATE: 2026-08-03
# NEXT REVIEW: 2026-09-03
# =============================================================================
audit-level=critical
